{"answer":"Originally shipped: 96 units (12 cartons × 8 units/carton). Subject to the records referring to the same shipment and the 3 damaged units being included in that shipment, usable units remaining: 93 (96 − 3). The records do not expressly establish that every shipped carton was received or rule out further losses, damage, or exclusions; thus 93 is a conditional net based only on the stated transit damage.","approaches":[{"description":"Combine the dispatch carton count with the packing specification, then deduct the stated unusable transit-damage count.","id":"record-arithmetic","outcome":"candidate","reason":"It gives 96 shipped and, under the stated linkage scope, 93 usable."},{"description":"Treat 93 as an unconditional received-and-usable inventory count.","id":"unconditional-inventory","outcome":"rejected","reason":"The supplied texts do not explicitly state complete receipt or exclude additional losses or exclusions."}],"change_log":[],"claims":[{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"shipment-count","citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":17}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"shipment-cartons","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The dispatch record states that 12 cartons were shipped.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"units-per-carton","citations":[{"end":69,"quote":"each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":41}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"carton-capacity","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The packing specification states that each carton contains 8 units.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"damage-record","citations":[{"end":65,"quote":"3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","source_id":"damage-record","start":18}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"transit-damage","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The receiving record states that 3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Multiplication of the stated carton count and units per carton in step-shipped-total.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["shipment-cartons","carton-capacity"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"originally-shipped","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The records imply an originally shipped total of 96 units.","step_ids":["step-shipped-total"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"local_assumption","basis_reference":"Scoped in step-link-records; it is not expressly stated in the supplied texts.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"same-shipment-scope","kind":"assumption","scope_step_ids":["step-link-records","step-usable-total"],"statement":"For the net calculation, the damage record concerns the shipment described by the dispatch and packing records, and its 3 damaged units are among the 96 shipped units.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Subtraction in step-usable-total under the scoped same-shipment assumption.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["originally-shipped","transit-damage","same-shipment-scope"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"conditional-usable","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":["step-link-records","step-usable-total"],"statement":"Under the same-shipment scope, 93 units remain usable after the stated damage adjustment.","step_ids":["step-usable-total"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"The supplied source assertions state shipment quantity, carton capacity, and three unusable damaged units, but contain no assertion of complete receipt or absence of other losses; therefore those propositions are not established by these records.","citations":[],"critical":false,"depends_on":["shipment-cartons","carton-capacity","transit-damage"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"scope-limitation","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"These records do not establish that all shipped cartons were received or that no additional losses, damage, or exclusions apply.","step_ids":["step-record-limit"],"tool_ids":[]}],"open_questions":["Were all 12 cartons received?","Do the three damaged units belong to the stated 12-carton shipment?","Were there any additional losses, rejected units, or exclusions beyond the three transit-damaged units?"],"proof_steps":[{"citations":[],"depends_on":[],"id":"step-link-records","justification":"This is a local scope assumption required because the damage text does not expressly identify the dispatch record by shipment identifier.","statement":"Assume the three damaged units are included in the 12-carton shipment governed by the eight-units-per-carton specification."},{"citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":17},{"end":69,"quote":"each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":41}],"depends_on":[],"id":"step-shipped-total","justification":"There are 12 cartons and 8 units in each carton, so 12 × 8 = 96.","statement":"Compute the originally shipped quantity as 96 units."},{"citations":[{"end":65,"quote":"3 units were damaged in transit and are not usable.","source_id":"damage-record","start":18}],"depends_on":["step-link-records","step-shipped-total"],"id":"step-usable-total","justification":"Under the linkage assumption, deduct the three expressly unusable units from the 96 shipped units: 96 − 3 = 93.","statement":"Compute the conditional usable quantity as 93 units."},{"citations":[],"depends_on":[],"id":"step-record-limit","justification":"The stated record contents establish quantities and the specified damage only; they do not assert complete receipt or the nonexistence of other adjustments.","statement":"Limit the conclusion to the stated damage adjustment rather than treating it as a complete receipt reconciliation."}],"question_status":"answered","tool_requests":[]}

