{"answer":"Originally shipped: 96 units (12 cartons × 8 units/carton). Subject to the records referring to the same shipment and the 3 damaged units being included in that shipment, usable units remaining: 93 (96 − 3). The records do not expressly establish that every shipped carton was received or rule out further losses, damage, or exclusions; thus 93 is a conditional net based only on the stated transit damage.","approaches":[{"description":"Combine the dispatch carton count with the packing specification, then deduct the stated unusable transit-damage count.","id":"record-arithmetic","outcome":"candidate","reason":"It gives 96 shipped and, under the stated linkage scope, 93 usable."},{"description":"Treat 93 as an unconditional received-and-usable inventory count.","id":"unconditional-inventory","outcome":"rejected","reason":"The supplied texts do not explicitly state complete receipt or exclude additional losses or exclusions."}],"change_log":["Changed same-shipment-scope from a local assumption to an additional assumption because it remains a stated condition rather than an assumption discharged by proof steps."],"claims":[{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"shipment-count","citations":[{"end":41,"quote":"12 cartons were shipped.","source_id":"shipment-count","start":17}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"shipment-cartons","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The dispatch record states that 12 cartons were shipped.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"units-per-carton","citations":[{"end":69,"quote":"each carton contains 8 units.","source_id":"units-per-carton","start":41}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"carton-capacity","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The packing specification states that each carton contains 8 units.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"damage-rec